# Cursor AI Rules for Hands-Off Engine

## Required First Step
Read `termux-hands-off/docs/HANDS_OFF_RESEARCH_REPORT_2025-11-20.md` before making any changes.

## Context
- AI-driven trading/finance automation running on Termux (Android)
- Must work WITHOUT: systemd, root access, Docker
- Must work WITH: Termux services, cron, pkg packages, Python venv

## Workflow
1. Read research report for current status and roadmap
2. Align proposed changes with documented roadmap
3. Use Termux-compatible solutions only
4. Test in dryrun/staging modes before production

## Philosophy
AI agents build it. Humans provide strategic direction only.
